# Documentation

## Update Map

| Change Type | Update |
|-------------|--------|
| New package | `docs/PACKAGE_GUIDE.md` |
| New feature | `docs/FEATURE_GUIDE.md` + `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` |
| New API endpoint | `docs/API_GUIDE.md` |
| New DS component | `docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` |
| New localization pattern | `docs/LOCALIZATION_GUIDE.md` |
| Architecture change | `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` + `docs/DEPENDENCY_GRAPH.md` |
| Security change | `docs/SECURITY.md` |
| Routing change | `docs/ROUTING.md` |
| Config/flavor change | `docs/CONFIGURATION.md` + `docs/FLAVORS.md` |
| Release | `docs/RELEASE.md` + CHANGELOG |

## Quality

- Keep code examples up to date with actual code — no stale examples
- Use project-accurate paths, class names, and commands
